[sliver] Local functional finishing reserve: these four 0.30 mm faces bound the apron-forming pocket. Its depth allows sanding/sealing of the forming face while the surrounding bare lands establish closure.
alternatives: Omitting the reserve changes the finished casting after coating. Increasing it to 3 mm changes the specified forming allowance. Retain the 0.30 mm process dimension.
